OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe east will be mainly dry and
OL,6,Fbright, some patchy rain later. The
OL,7,Fwest cloudier will be cloudier with
OL,8,Foccasional rain turning more
OL,9,Fpersistent later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cloudy evening with
OL,12,Foccasional outbreaks of rain, mainly
OL,13,Facross western areas. Remaining cloudy
OL,14,Fthrough the night with a risk of
OL,15,Ffurther rain at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
