OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FPatchy rain clears away during
OL,6,Fthe morning. The afternoon will then
OL,7,Fbe mainly dry with sunny spells, just
OL,8,Fthe risk of the odd light shower
OL,9,Facross Stirlingshire and west
OL,10,FPerthshire.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry,
OL,13,Fbright with variable amounts of cloud
OL,14,Fand some hazy sunny spells. Becoming
OL,15,Fwarm or very warm, but fresher at
OL,16,Ftimes on the east coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
